      "text": "Quantifying mixed-state entanglement via partial transpose and realignment moments — 37 sections: Front matter; Preliminaries; Quantitative\n\n**Quantifying mixed-state entanglement via partial transpose and realignment moments**\n\n*Poetri Sonya Tarabunga1,2 and Tobias Haug3*\n\n43 pp, 37 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 2 Preliminaries; 3 Quantitative; 3.1 From the PT moments; 3.2 From the realignment moments; 3.3 Symmetry-resolved; 4 Quantifying; 5 Relation to operator space entanglement entr; 6 Entanglement testing; 7 Circuit depth certification; 8 Pseudorandom density matrices and pseudoenta; 9 Entanglement phase diagram; 9.1 Haar random states; 9.2 Stabilizer states; 10 Entanglement and noise; 11 Matrix product states and matrix product op; 11.1 Partial transpose moments; 11.2 Realignment moments",
